    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "That was for my sake, huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "She's such a worrywart..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "We'd better speed up, or we won't make it.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "You saw what tough customers those Infected were back there. That's a lot for one operator, or even one team to handle."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "I really should've put that kid to bed once and for all back on the rooftop."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Oh, copy."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
            "volume": 0.4
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "If you don't get your butt to the ambush point, I'll take all of last year's disciplinary reports and hand them over to Dr. Kal'tsit!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#6"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Settle down! I'll be there right on time!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Amiya! She's scratching my coat!;......;Could you put me down when you take a call?",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Blaze!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "What am I supposed to do? We have to hurry..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "(You'll pay for that one!)"
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Why so quiet, Doctor?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "......Blaze!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "I didn't do anything! It's the Doctor who clammed up!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Tell her already!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Come on, say something...!"
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 3
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Huh...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Sorry, Doctor. I forgot you and Blaze would definitely go at it like this..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#7"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "I do what I gotta do."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Why are you so pleased with yourself?"
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
            "volume": 0.4
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Anyway, all I need is your location and current operation."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "You two seem to be getting along."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#7"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Sure are!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "...Really?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#9"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "(Wait, what's happening here? What should I tell her?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "(I don't know.);(Say nothing.);(I'm not sure.)",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "(This is bad! Red alert! I'm taking psychic damage! I need guidance!)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Keep at it."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$transmission",
            "volume": 0.4
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "She hung up!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Oh no. We're in trouble."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "But at least we're here. Let's take a load off."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "But this is the highest point in the district?",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Well... shit."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "You know what they say, the shortest distance between two points is a straight line. Let's hop down."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Hop? From this high?",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Yep. Yawn."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Hold on... If I'm not mistaken... That's Mephisto's team over there to the east, moving to the ambush zone."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "And over there... the scaly kid?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "He's taking his team to fight something. What is all that black there?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#6"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Is that the herd...? With those numbers?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#9"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Looks like we can't rest here, Doctor. Let's go. Time for the final battle!"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
            "volume": 0.4
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Hey, Amiya. Hey!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "I'm taking the Doctor into the fight!"
    },
