        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "It's an ambush! The L. G. D. is pushing us in!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_016",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Push through to the slums. Even though we haven't heard from Crownslayer... the slums are our only way out."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Take him."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_016",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "What are you going to do?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_016",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Me and a few teams have encouraged the 'herd' to gather up here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "They won't attack me, so I can fight alongside them."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer",
        "text": "Fire in the hole!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member",
        "text": "We can't hold for long!"
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 1,
            "xstrength": 8,
            "ystrength": 6,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Herd",
        "text": "Ugh... Guhhh!!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer",
        "text": "It's those special Infected! Look out!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 0.5,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 0.5,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_016",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "You'll bring up the rear?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "You're not coming back."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_016",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "Mmm! Mmhhh!!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_016",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Let him speak. He can't do his Arts like this."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
            "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "What are you doing?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
            "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Mephisto..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#4",
            "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "What are you doing?! You can't do this! Come back! Please! Come back here!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#4",
            "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "You once told me you would do anything I asked you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
            "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "Sasha!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
            "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "You said you don't want to make decisions for yourself."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "It's just, if you have your own ideas and your own goals now... I can't blame you for your choices."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "If that's the way it is, Mephisto... Well, that's great."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "But..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "I'm out of options."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "So let me tell you my last wish."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#4",
            "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "Sasha...? What are you talking about? I don't understand!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer",
        "text": "Don't let them escape! Take out their commanders!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Ah...!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "...The Rhodes Island swallow?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "(Mouthing 'pull the trigger.')"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer",
        "text": "Hit the deck! Watch the crossfire! We've got them surrounded!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "\u2014\u2014!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer",
        "text": "Fall back, Rhodes Island crossbowman! This corridor is ours!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_016",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "Faust! Run!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "No."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Crossbowmen, I know FrostNova is on her way. And even though Crownslayer is missing, her people are out there in the slums somewhere."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "When FrostNova gets here, you're under her command."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "I trust her. Once she arrives, you'll be okay."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "And with my Originium Arts, you'll be invisible."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_016",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "You can't, Faust! That will rupture your organs!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Doesn't matter. There's no reason not to do it anymore."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Retreat. That's an order."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "And take him with you. But not to Chernobog."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_016",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "...Faust..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#3",
            "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "You can't do this!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "I hope you survive. Even on your own."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Don't die."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "\u2014\u2014That's my last wish."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "Sasha! Sashaaaaa!!!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "I don't want to hurt anyone. I don't want to get anyone hurt."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "I wish we had just run away, back then."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "We could have... just run away."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "Sasha, you promised! We promised each other! We swore we would survive together!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "It's too late... for me..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "...I'm too tired."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "Sashaaaaaa!!!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "Goodbye, Eno."
    },
